{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45143","headline":"春日又送潘述之扬州 · 皎然","name":"春日又送潘述之扬州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别渚望邗城，岐路春日徧。\n柔风吹杨柳，芳景流郊甸。\n日日东林期，今夕异乡县。\n文房旷佳士，禅室阻清盼。\n离恨夺赏心，不得谐所愿。\n莫忆山中人，碧云遥可见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}